&lt;li&gt;Exceptional leadership skills and experience developing high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen and ability to align events to organizational objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence with outstanding communication and presentation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
