&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency: &lt;/strong&gt;The base pay for this role is: $163,944 - 215,177 per year. You are also eligible for employee benefits, participation in Oscar&#39;s unlimited vacation program and annual performance bonuses.&lt;/p&gt;
