&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Manage and coach high performing corporate FP&amp;amp;A professionals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication: &lt;/strong&gt;Communicate financial results, trends, and recommendations to leadership and other stakeholders in a clear and concise manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
