&lt;li&gt;7+ years experience in FP&amp;amp;A roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated strong analytical &amp;amp; problem solving experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert financial modeling experience and ability to effectively translate data into actionable insights, strategies, and financial plans&lt;/li&gt;
