&lt;li&gt;Experience in health insurance, managed care or insurance industries&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBA in Finance, MS in Financial Analysis&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL/BigQuery to analyze large data sets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency working with Workday and Adaptive&lt;/li&gt;
