&lt;p&gt;Operating at the center of Insurance Product, Finance, Network, and Sales, you will translate complex data into clear recommendations and help shape decisions on where and how the business competes and grows. The person in this role develops strategies and transitions them to market teams for execution, requiring strong alignment, clarity, and follow-through.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report into the Vice President, Insurance Product Innovation and Development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location:&lt;/strong&gt; This is a remote / work-from-home role. You must reside in one of the following states: Arizona, California, Colorado, Florida, Georgia, Illinois, Massachusetts, Michigan, Nevada, New Jersey, New York, North Carolina, Ohio, Pennsylvania, Texas, or Virginia. Note, this list of states is subject to change. #LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
