&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Strategy Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support development of market strategies to achieve growth, retention, and performance improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze market dynamics, competitive positioning, and regulatory factors to inform right to win strategies (product, network, market share)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with market leaders to prioritize opportunities and refine local strategic plans, as part of our multi-year strategy development effort&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Market Expansion &amp;amp; Entry&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct analysis to support new market entry and expansion opportunities based on product receptivity, market sizing, competitor landscape, and regulatory considerations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to development of business cases in partnership with corporate finance, sales, growth, network, and market leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support leadership decision-making with clear, data-driven insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Portfolio Optimization &amp;amp; Performance&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze product and market performance to identify optimization and remediation opportunities related to product offerings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support recommendations on portfolio changes, including plan positioning and market or demographic specific adjustments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor important performance trends across markets and segments served, alongside market leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Partnership &amp;amp; Innovation Support&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze opportunities across important member segments, while supporting development of segment- strategies and growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with finance, network, sales, marketing, product, and clinical to agree on opportunities and recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex analyses into clear, relevant insights for partners, while supporting transition of approved strategies for market leadership to implement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Insight Generation &amp;amp; Decision Support&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Summarize internal data, market intelligence, and competitive intelligence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop executive ready materials and narratives to support rapid decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a disciplined fact-based approach to market strategic efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance with all applicable laws and regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
