&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in market analysis, performance evaluation, or growth strategy support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing business cases and recommendations alongside market and product leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel up to 25%.&lt;/li&gt;
