&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master of Business Administration or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience within ACA, IFP, or adjacent healthcare markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with market entry strategy, product portfolio optimization, or provider/network strategy development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting senior leadership decision-making processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to value-based care models, partnerships, or healthcare ecosystem strategy, focused on health insurance&lt;/li&gt;
